<card id="c" title="Questions That Won&apos;t Make You Feel Better After Knowing the Answers">
<do type="prev" label="Back"><prev/></do>
<p>- What is a Promise? How to debug errors?</p>
<p>- What is Async/Await and what do transpilers compile it into? And how to debug them?</p>
<p>- What are generators?</p>
